<title>USA: Aspec Technology IPO delayed - underwriter.</title>
<headline>Aspec Technology IPO delayed - underwriter.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aspec Technology Inc's initial public offering, valued at around $36 million, has been delayed, according to underwriter Alex Brown.</p>
<p>The underwriter did not give a reason for the delay.</p>
<p>The Sunnyvale, Calif.-based company had initially filed for a four million share issue with a price range of $10 to $12 per share.  The estimated range was later cut to $8 to $10.</p>
<p>Aspec is a provider of commercially available design implementation technology solutions for integrated circuit design.</p>
</text>
